mment-4902397341","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120583","id":4902397341,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJDSlnQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-07T09:44:01Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T09:44:01Z","body":"I can't speak to this not my area","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4902397341/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4957559616","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120583#issuecomment-4957559616","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120583","id":4957559616,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ35bQA","user":{"login":"pyhfen","id":304356368,"node_id":"U_kgDOEiQcEA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/304356368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyhfen","html_url":"https://github.com/pyhfen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyhfen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyhfen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyhfen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyhfen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyhfen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyhfen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyhfen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyhfen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pyhfen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T11:42:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T11:42:06Z","body":"I think you should reduce `coverage = (coverage_x + coverage_y) * 0.5f`. Its very common to look forward & walk backwards in games. With the current value, it results in nearby shadows having lower resolution, since the closest light source has less coverage than the previous, because the previous light source now covers the entire screen due to us still looking at it.\r\n\r\n[comp.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9db51310-5317-4e9b-b3d3-b21d1744962e)\r\n\r\nHowever, if a light only cast wall shadows & there is a much larger but further away light that should be prioritized, there would have to be a coverage value in Light3D to be fed into the coverage calculations. The light that only cast walll shadows can have a negative value to make sure it never cast high resolution shadows & the larger light can have a larger value so it can cast high resolution shadows despite being further away.\r\n\r\nBTW thank you so much for this. My shadow quadrants were 16-16-16-16, because of both resolution flicker & incorrect selection. Now im using 4-4-4-64. Nearby shadows are alwasy high resolution & they never flicker between resolutions when rotating the camera.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4957559616/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]